      "username": "Sudhanshu",
      "name": "Sudhanshu Badole",
      "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:15:55.021Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, exactly—that’s why I built this custom app.<br>\nIt gives me the freedom to design any UI I want, and I’m working on making it fully dynamic.</p>\n<p>Would love to hear your suggestions on improving it!</p>\n<hr>\n<aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"154335\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/sudhanshu/48/68856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/modern-desk-ui-for-frappe-v14-v15-inspired-by-v16/154335\">Modern Desk UI for Frappe v14 &amp; v15 — Inspired by v16</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/framework/app-development/24\"><span data-category-id=\"24\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #0E76BD; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #F7941D;\" data-parent-category-id=\"5\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --has-parent\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">App Development</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Hey everyone <img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/wave.png?v=12\" title=\"wave\" alt=\"wave\" class=\"emoji\">, \nRecently I attended Frappeverse 2025 and got a glimpse of the upcoming Frappe v16 — the new Desk UI looks so clean, modern &amp; exciting! \nBut when I came back to my day-to-day work on v14 &amp; v15, the UI started to feel a bit old &amp; boring <img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sweat_smile.png?v=12\" title=\"sweat_smile\" alt=\"sweat_smile\" class=\"emoji\">. \nSo, I decided to build a Modern Desk UI for v14 &amp; v15 users — using Frappe UI + Vue.js. \n<img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/point_right.png?v=12\" title=\"point_right\" alt=\"point_right\" class=\"emoji\"> What I’ve built so far: \n\n<img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/zap.png?v=12\" title=\"zap\" alt=\"zap\" class=\"emoji\"> Dynamic List View — auto shows fields marked In List View as columns\n<img width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/mag_right.png?v=12\" title=\"mag_right\" alt=\"mag_right\" class=\"emoji\"> In-List Fil…\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
