      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/bahaou\">@bahaou</a> <strong>UI is crucial.</strong> Frappe’s simplicity is great, but for someone spending 40 hours a week in front of it, the lack of color can feel depressing. It’s easy to understand why some companies feel it isn’t a good fit; because in a work environment, a pleasing UI isn’t a luxury, it’s essential. For many, the interface is like a second home. Frappe could offer a more visually engaging design while still preserving its minimalistic style.</p>",
